Value Required ID (\d+)
Value PORT (\S+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value CONSISTENCY (\S+)
Value CONSISTENCY_REASON (.+?)
Value List ACTIVE_VLANS ([0-9,\-]+)

Start
  ^vPC status\s*$$ -> Members

Members
  ^\d+\s+\S+\s+ -> Continue.Record
  ^${ID}\s+${PORT}\s+${STATUS}\s+${CONSISTENCY}\s+${CONSISTENCY_REASON}\s{2,}${ACTIVE_VLANS}\s*$$
  ^\s{20,}${ACTIVE_VLANS}\s*$$
